 years ago; Crawled: 3 days ago; [论文评述] PASTA: Towards Flexible and Efficient HDR Imaging Via Progressively Aggregated Spatio-Temporal Alignment\n\nXiaoning Liu, Ao Li 等6名|2024年3月\n\n[论文评述] PASTA: Towards Flexible and Efficient HDR Imaging Via Progressively Aggregated Spatio-Temporal Alignment\n\nXiaoning Liu, Ao Li 等6名|2024年3月\n\nTL;DR\n\n解决高分辨率HDR鬼影处理的计算难题，PASTA框架以分层聚合与时域注意力实现高速高效成像。\n\n这篇论文的标题为“PASTA: Towards Flexible and Efficient HDR Imaging Via Progressively Aggregated Spatio-Temporal Alignment”。论文的主要贡献是提出了一种新的高动态范围（HDR）去鬼影框架，称为“PASTA（Progressively Aggregated Spatio-Temporal Alignment）”。该框架旨在解决当前HDR图像处理方法在高分辨率图像下的计算复杂性和延迟问题，同时保持高质量的视觉效果。\n\n### 1. 研究背景与动机\n\nHDR图像处理的目标是通过结合多张不同曝光的低动态范围（LDR）图像，从而拓展图像的动态范围，改善视觉质量。然而，帧与帧之间的对齐以及在不同曝光下的合成仍然是一个难点，特别是在动态场景中，运动和抖动会导致对齐错误和鬼影现象。--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCVPR 2020 | ML Anthology (https://mlanthology.org/cvpr/2020/)\nciteturn34search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Attention-Guided Hierarchical Structure Aggregation for Image Matting Yu Qiao, Yuhao Liu, Xin Yang, Dongsheng Zhou, Mingliang Xu, Qiang Zhang, Xiaopeng Wei ... Contextual Residual Aggregation for Ultra High-Resolution Image Inpainting Zili Yi, Qiang Tang, Shekoofeh Azizi, Daesik Jang, Zhan Xu ... Exploring Spatial-Temporal Multi-Frequency Analysis for High-Fidelity and Temporal-Consistency Video Prediction Beibei Jin, Yu Hu, Qiankun Tang, Jingyu Niu, Zhiping Shi, Yinhe Han, Xiaowei Li ... Improving Action Segmentation via Graph-Based Temporal Reasoning Yifei Huang, Yusuke Sugano, Yoichi Sato ... PnPNet: End-to-End Perception and Prediction with Tracking in the Loop Ming Liang, Bin Yang, Wenyuan Zeng, Yun Chen, Rui Hu, Sergio Casas, Raquel Urtasun ... ProAlignNet: Unsupervised Learning for Progressively Aligning Noisy Contours Vsr Veeravasarapu, Abhishek Goel, Deepak Mittal, Maneesh Singh ... Progressive Adversarial Networks for Fine-Grained Domain Adaptation Sinan Wang, Xinyang Chen, Yunbo Wang, Mingsh